%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: DetectiveMonika_checkWitnesses
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We should talk to the two regulars, see if they might've witnessed anything.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189335
    - rid: 1790118809755189340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, captain.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you mind letting us go? It's bad enough that we can't get our drink.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189405
    - rid: 1790118809755189406
    - rid: 1790118809755189407
    - rid: 1790118809755189408
    - rid: 1790118809755189409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We'll be out of your hair soon enough, for now, we have some questions
      for the both of you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: How well did you know the victim?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189413
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: I knew he owned this place together with his brother, and also had a
      stand in the market square where he sold meat he hunted.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189414
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: I've heard he could be a bit rude, but I didn't really know him personally.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't know him personally, I take care not to get attached to people
      who could be here one day and gone tomorrow.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you were aware that the victim might've died soon?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: Only because he is mortal; I didn't know yesterday would be his last
      day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Right...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Can you think of anyone who would want him dead?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm... I recall overhearing an unpleasant conversation between him and
      Olfina Grey-Mane where she all but threatened him-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189419
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: Ignore him, he's just trying to find an excuse to put the Grey-Manes
      down a peg.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (She's probably right.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Within the past day, did you notice anything strange here in Whiterun?
      For example, a strange-looking visitor?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189421
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I've heard rumors of a girl with pink wolf ears walking around
      town-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189423
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, I already know about that, she's got nothing to do with this.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: When I was returning after a night of mercenary work yesterday, I only
      saw one person leaving town- it was past midnight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: She didn't seem to be tired, despite it being so late- which would make
      sense if they were in my field of work-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: But, she had the garb of ordinary townsfolk, so I find that detail a
      bit odd.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Can you tell us what she looked like?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: She was a fellow Dunmer, otherwise fairly unassuming.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Were you able to tell where she was heading?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22aab3b38c65db143b4c5ee394c09b04, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I was much more focused on getting my well-earned rest for the night.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So all we know about our prime suspect is that she is a Dunmer woman
      who recently left Whiterun...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (Should we tell the patrols to look out for Dunmer women?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We should keep track of them, but try not to harass them; no stopping
      on the roads and interrogating them.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: (If you say so, captain.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's all the questions we had. You're free to go.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189431
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e71697a8e06ad1458bb938e81dc25fe, type: 2}
    dialog: Finally...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189432
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189433
    - rid: 1790118809755189434
    - rid: 1790118809755189435
    - rid: 1790118809755189436
    - rid: 1790118809755189437
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
